# Claude Code hook events. Format: <event>[:<matcher>] <activity|clear> [<from-activity>,...]
# The optional third field applies the action only when the pane is in one of
# those activities. `pane-status agent hooks claude-code` generates settings from this.

# compact is omitted: it can fire mid-turn.
SessionStart:startup            idle
SessionStart:resume             idle
SessionStart:clear              idle
UserPromptSubmit                working
PreToolUse                      working
PostToolUse                     working
PostToolUseFailure              working
Notification:permission_prompt  waiting
Notification:elicitation_dialog waiting
Stop                            idle
StopFailure                     error
# Not on clear: SessionStart:clear follows it.
SessionEnd:logout|prompt_input_exit|other clear
